        "thought_text": "I apologize for the oversight. The error in the previous solution was in the calculation of the maximum number of targets destroyable. The current approach doesn't account for the case where multiple rows and columns have the same maximum number of targets. Let's refine the reasoning step to correctly handle this scenario by considering the overlap of targets in the rows and columns with the maximum number of targets.",
